ls in US dollars, 0 to about 2,600; series are Baseline and 'Air, Attic, Duct Sealing/Insulation'. The all-fuels bill falls from about $2,620 to about $2,200, electricity from about $1,860 to about $1,650, and natural gas from about $520 to about $380.", "metadata": {"product": "resstock", "release": "resstock_amy2018_2025_release_1", "source_id": "upgrade_measures", "source_type": "pdf", "source_path": "measure_pdfs/96347.pdf", "doc_title": "Advanced Air Sealing, Attic Floor Insulation, and Duct Sealing and Insulation", "section": "4.3  Stock Utility Bill Impacts", "line_start": 470, "line_end": 481, "corpus_version": "resstock_amy2018_2025_release_1-v1", "status": "osti_pdf", "measure_id": "15", "measure_name": "Advanced Air Sealing, Attic Floor Insulation, and Duct Sealing and Insulation", "measure_initial_release": "ResStock 2025 Release 1", "date_last_updated": "2026-04-14", "date_last_updated_source": "pdf_moddate"}}
