{"id": "upgrade_measures|measure_pdfs/96738.pdf|19", "text": "Advanced Air Sealing \u2014 Accessing Results\n\nThis documentation covers the ' advanced air s ealing' measure upgrade methodology and briefly discusses key results. All results can be accessed on the ResStock Open Energy Data Initiative 'End -Use Load Profiles for the U.S. Building Stock' data lake and on the data viewer at resstock.nlr.gov.", "metadata": {"product": "resstock", "release": "resstock_amy2018_2025_release_1", "source_id": "upgrade_measures", "source_type": "pdf", "source_path": "measure_pdfs/96738.pdf", "doc_title": "Advanced Air Sealing", "section": "Accessing Results", "line_start": 200, "line_end": 200, "corpus_version": "resstock_amy2018_2025_release_1-v1", "status": "osti_pdf", "measure_id": "11", "measure_name": "Advanced Air Sealing", "measure_initial_release": "ResStock 2025 Release 1", "date_last_updated": "2026-10-29", "date_last_updated_source": "pdf_moddate"}}
